// m0306 — DJI Phantom 3 flight controller (STM32F427IIH6) platform for Renode.
//
// Extends Renode's stock STM32F429 description (same F42x/F43x family core: NVIC, GPIO,
// USART/UART, SPI, CAN, DMA, modeled RCC). Used read/trace-only, per CLAUDE.md: no
// control-command sending, no geofence work.
//
// Firmware facts (docs/air-id-and-stream-survey.md, this session's static trace):
//   app base 0x08020000, initial SP 0x2002ff00, reset vector 0x08021965 (thumb bit set)
//   flash 2 MiB (fits stock 0x200000), SRAM 256 KiB (fits stock 0x40000)
//
// Unlike m0900 (STM32F103, RCC unmodeled -> needed an RCC_CFGR Tag workaround), the stock
// stm32f429.repl's `rcc: Miscellaneous.STM32F4_RCC` models clock-switch status, so no
// RCC_CFGR tag is expected to be needed here. If the clock-switch wait still spins, add the
// same Tag pattern used in m0900.repl (docs/fpga-bringup.md gotcha).
using "platforms/cpus/stm32f429.repl"
